ore interesting is  what bray notices when jon finds ghost  you see john doesn't find ghost as fast  as he did in the show  they are actually already leaving and  it's when they're halfway across the  bridge that jon hears something in the  distance  this causes him to stop and jon says  don't you hear  it bran hears the wind in the trees and  the horse's hooves on the iron wood  planks  but jon was listening to something else  john swings his horse around  and races back across the bridge  everyone watches john dismount  where the mother direwolf was laying  dead in the snow they watch him as he  kneels down  and a moment later he was riding back  only now he was smiling  he must have crawled away from the  others john said  now john found ghost his fur was white  where the rest of the litter was gray  his eyes were as red as the blood of the  ragged man who died this morning  bran thought it was curious that this  direwolf alone would have opened its  eyes  while the others were still blind in  albino  theon greyjoy says this one will die  even faster than the others  john says i think not this one belongs  to me  alright so there is a lot of fascinating  things to unpack right here  first i want to mention some of the  similarities between jon and ghost  here it says his fur is white where the  rest of the litter was gray  this shows how ghost stands out from the  rest similar to john  who as we all know is not actually ned's  son  jon is the outcast of the bunch just  like ghost  also brain said there was little john's  eyes did not see  and like we learned here ghost already  had his eyes open  whereas the rest of the litter was still  blind this makes you wonder how much of  a connection jon and ghost already had  maybe jon was already inside the mind of  ghost without even knowing it  i mean he did somehow hear him after all  when it is said that ghost is silent  unlike the other direwolves ghost does  not bark and he moves silently on his  feet  so how did jon hear him did they already  have a magical bond  most likely or maybe something else was  happening here  i think something very special was  happening when jon found  ghost something that i will not easily  be able to explain  in this video i actually already made a  video about the reason i think jon was  able to find ghosts the way that he did  i think you will find it to be very  interesting if you haven't seen it  already  i might release that video again this  week while i'm working on the next  chapter video  but we shall see also if you remember  earlier in the chapter we hear about  rob and john racing on their horses it  said that rob was laughing  where jon was silent and intent like i  said a second ago  ghost is also known for being very  silent so i think this is another  similarity between jon and ghost  they both move silently also when it  mentions ghost having his eyes open  first  this may symbolize jon opening his eyes  first  robb said the deserter died bravely but  jon knew otherwise  he knew the man was afraid of something  we are also told that bastards have to  grow up faster than the other children  this may also represent that jon has  some level of maturity before the other  children  his eyes are already open to the world  around him  in fact john even says a bastard has to  learn to notice things  to read the truth that people hide  behind their eyes so i think this lines  up really well with ghost already having  his eyes open  or at least it makes sense to me one  other thing i want to mention is what  theon greyjoy said about ghost  he said an albino this one will die even  faster than the others  then jon says i think not this one  belongs to me  john is absolutely right as we all know  ghost will not be the first one to die  in fact i could even make an argument  that ghost is more important than all  the other direwolves  he finds the white hand out beyond the  wall he alerts  jon when the white is attacking lore  commander mormont  ghost is the one that finds the  dragonglass and most likely the horn of  winter out beyond the wall as well  and not to mention jon will most likely  use ghost as a vessel  to keep his mind alive as his body is  bleeding out  this will help jon significantly during  his resurrection  so that jon can go on and be  instrumental in the defeat of the white  walkers  but we shall see let me know your  thoughts on this chapter  in my opinion this one sets up so many  things for the future of the series  as i said before i may release a video  this week about the connection between  the starks and the white walkers  as well as the connection between jon  and ghost  i have already made some videos where i  laid out all the evidence so i may  update those then release them to help  add some context to the things i  mentioned  in the first two chapter videos also i  want to mention that i have made some  new shirts that are on sale right now  if you are interested in grabbing one of  these there will be a link down below  if you do buy one make sure you send me  an email of a photo of you wearing the  shirt  that way i can add it to one of my  videos anyways i want to thank everyone  for stopping by to watch the video  as always i really appreciate that  hopefully  you all come back to watch the next one  have a great day  i will see you again very soon bye  [Music]  so  you
 

